{"id":400300802,"chapter_id":50014,"scene_id":51416,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"唔……","voice":["vo_event_03008_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"丽莎","content":"别一个人耍帅逞强了，剩下的这些怪物交给我就好。","voice":["vo_event_03008_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"那怎么行，丽莎小姐这么干净的一双手，可不是拿来做这些的。","voice":["vo_event_03008_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"手起刀落，最后几只黑影化为轻烟，但麦昆的脸色却又难看了几分。","style":3,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"丽莎","content":"你……","voice":["vo_event_03008_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"好了好了，你不适合讲那些关心人的话，我会不习惯的。","voice":["vo_event_03008_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"我说过，这场展览的异变，或许就是魔女对我们这些贪心新城人的惩罚。丽莎小姐不需要承受这些。","voice":["vo_event_03008_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"况且，我们已经达成了交易，你帮我找到出口，我护送你出去，不是吗？","voice":["vo_event_03008_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"丽莎","content":"我才不认可什么交易，少拿这种买卖关系绑架我。","voice":["vo_event_03008_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"呜呜我的好姑奶奶，言而有信可是我最后仅剩的一点做人底线了，就别拒绝了嘛。","voice":["vo_event_03008_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"丽莎","content":"切，管你什么交易……被几只这么弱的小怪就欺负成这样，我可不放心让你来护送我。","voice":["vo_event_03008_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"丽莎嘴上抱怨着，却也没有继续反驳，甚至顾及麦昆的情况，刻意放慢了脚步。","style":3,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"很弱吗？<color=#7683a2><size=24><i>……果然是冲我来的，现在还没到让丽莎出手的时候……</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_event_03008_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"丽莎","content":"你嘀咕什么呢？","voice":["vo_event_03008_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"没什么……丽莎小姐不是说要保持五米距离吗？怎么越靠越近了？","voice":["vo_event_03008_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"原来还是被我的魅力征服了嘛——","voice":["vo_event_03008_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"丽莎","content":"……","voice":["vo_event_03008_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"麦昆","content":"诶……<size=44>等等我！别加速啊！丽莎小姐——</size>","voice":["vo_event_03008_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1c","style":1,"background":2027,"log_type":1}]}